Becoming.Withholding.Ring.loop : Becoming.Withholding.Chain Becoming.Withholding.Ring.Waits 3
  Becoming.Withholding.Ring.first Becoming.Withholding.Ring.first
Becoming.Withholding.Ring.waitsAll_absorbs_exact : (∀ (n : Nat),
